@startuml
title Commerce platform - C4 container diagram approximation

' Scope: Commerce platform containers
' Evidence:
' - docker-compose.yml
' - docs/architecture.md
' Assumptions:
' - Approximated using PlantUML components.

actor "Customer" as Customer
component "Web App" <<container>> as Web
component "API Service" <<container>> as API
component "Worker Service" <<container>> as Worker
database "PostgreSQL" <<container/database>> as DB
queue "Kafka" <<container/queue>> as Kafka
component "Payment Provider" <<external system>> as PSP

Customer --> Web
Web --> API : HTTPS/JSON
API --> DB
API --> Kafka
Worker --> Kafka
Worker --> DB
API --> PSP

@enduml
